================================================================================
3. MINDS-14: third-party data, CC BY 4.0
================================================================================

`data/processed/minds14_en.csv`, and the files in `results/` that contain its messages,
are derived from the MINDS-14 dataset by PolyAI. MINDS-14 is not covered by the licenses
above; it is used and redistributed here under its own license, CC BY 4.0.

- Source: https://huggingface.co/datasets/PolyAI/minds14
- Paper: Gerz et al. (2021), "Multilingual and Cross-Lingual Intent Detection from
  Spoken Data", https://arxiv.org/abs/2104.08524
- Changes made: kept only the English configurations (en-US, en-GB, en-AU) and the
  transcription and intent fields; intent numbers converted to intent names.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
